{"seq":2,"slug":"blockwise-recompute","title":"分块与重计算","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/blockwise-recompute","wordCount":1439,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"分块与重计算\">分块与重计算</h1><p>FlashAttention 解决了前向注意力不落地大矩阵的问题，但两个更难的场景还悬着：反向传播天然需要前向的中间结果来算梯度，而单卡再省显存也装不下一条百万 token 的序列。这一篇把「分块」思想推广到这两处——用<strong>重计算</strong>换显存、用<strong>序列并行</strong>跨多卡切长序列。它是本 hub 里「让长序列的训练与超长推理在有限硬件上跑起来」的主讲。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-用算力换显存的基本盘\">核心概念：用算力换显存的基本盘</h2><p>深度网络反向传播要用到前向的中间激活。朴素做法是前向时把每层激活都存下来，反向时取用——显存随层数和序列长度线性堆积。<strong>梯度检查点（gradient checkpointing / 重计算）</strong> 的思想是：前向时只保存少数「检查点」激活，其余丢弃；反向需要某段激活时，从最近的检查点<strong>重新前向计算</strong>一次。</p>\n<p>这是一笔明确的交易：多花一次前向的算力，换回不必存储中间激活的显存。</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>显存</mtext><mo>:</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>→</mo><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><msqrt><mi>L</mi></msqrt><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext> 或 </mtext><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>1</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mtext>段</mtext><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mspace width=\"2em\"/><mtext>算力</mtext><mo>:</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>×</mo><mo>→</mo><mo>≈</mo><mn>1.33</mn><mo>×</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{显存}: O(L)\\to O(\\sqrt{L})\\ \\text{或}\\ O(1)\\text{段},\\qquad \\text{算力}: 1\\times \\to \\approx 1.33\\times</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">显存</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2255em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord sqrt\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9755em;\"><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\" style=\"padding-left:0.833em;\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-2.9355em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"min-width:0.853em;height:1.08em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"1.08em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 1080\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMinYMin slice\"><path d=\"M95,702\nc-2.7,0,-7.17,-2.7,-13.5,-8c-5.8,-5.3,-9.5,-10,-9.5,-14\nc0,-2,0.3,-3.3,1,-4c1.3,-2.7,23.83,-20.7,67.5,-54\nc44.2,-33.3,65.8,-50.3,66.5,-51c1.3,-1.3,3,-2,5,-2c4.7,0,8.7,3.3,12,10\ns173,378,173,378c0.7,0,35.3,-71,104,-213c68.7,-142,137.5,-285,206.5,-429\nc69,-144,104.5,-217.7,106.5,-221\nl0 -0\nc5.3,-9.3,12,-14,20,-14\nH400000v40H845.2724\ns-225.272,467,-225.272,467s-235,486,-235,486c-2.7,4.7,-9,7,-19,7\nc-6,0,-10,-1,-12,-3s-194,-422,-194,-422s-65,47,-65,47z\nM834 80h400000v40h-400000z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.0645em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">或</span></span><span class=\"mspace\"> </span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">段</span></span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:2em;\"></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">算力</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">:</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→≈</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7278em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1.33</span><span class=\"mord\">×</span></span></span></span></span></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Fwd[&quot;前向传播&quot;] --&gt; Save[&quot;只存检查点激活&lt;br/&gt;丢弃段内中间值&quot;]&#10;    Save --&gt; Bwd[&quot;反向到某段&quot;]&#10;    Bwd --&gt; Need{&quot;需要段内激活?&quot;}&#10;    Need --&gt;|&quot;是&quot;| Recomp[&quot;从检查点重算前向&lt;br/&gt;额外一次计算&quot;]&#10;    Need --&gt;|&quot;否&quot;| Grad[&quot;直接用检查点算梯度&quot;]&#10;    Recomp --&gt; Grad&#10;    Grad --&gt; Done[&quot;梯度回传&lt;br/&gt;峰值显存大降&quot;]\">flowchart TD\n    Fwd[\"前向传播\"] --&gt; Save[\"只存检查点激活&lt;br/&gt;丢弃段内中间值\"]\n    Save --&gt; Bwd[\"反向到某段\"]\n    Bwd --&gt; Need{\"需要段内激活?\"}\n    Need --&gt;|\"是\"| Recomp[\"从检查点重算前向&lt;br/&gt;额外一次计算\"]\n    Need --&gt;|\"否\"| Grad[\"直接用检查点算梯度\"]\n    Recomp --&gt; Grad\n    Grad --&gt; Done[\"梯度回传&lt;br/&gt;峰值显存大降\"]</pre><h2 id=\"flashattention-的反向-重计算是内建的\">FlashAttention 的反向：重计算是内建的</h2><p>FlashAttention 前向不存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span> 矩阵，这带来一个直接问题：反向传播算 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>Q</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>K</mi><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mi>V</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">Q,K,V</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">Q</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">K</span><span class=\"mpunct\">,</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\">V</span></span></span></span></span> 的梯度本来需要这张 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>。答案正是重计算——FlashAttention 前向时只额外保存两个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的向量（每行的 softmax 归一化统计量 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>m</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">m</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">m</span></span></span></span></span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">ℓ</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\ell</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">ℓ</span></span></span></span></span>），反向时用它们<strong>在片上重新算出所需的注意力块</strong>，而不是从 HBM 读回整张矩阵。</p>\n<p>这让 FlashAttention 的反向同样是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显存。重计算在这里不是可选优化，而是「不落地大矩阵」这一设计的必然配套：既然前向就不存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">A</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">A</span></span></span></span></span>，反向自然只能重算。这也解释了为什么 <a href=\"flash-attention\">FlashAttention</a> 的反向加速比前向略低（FA4 在 B200 上前向约 3.6 倍、反向约 3.15 倍）——反向多背了一次重计算的算力。对训练而言这笔账极划算：训练的瓶颈几乎总是显存，用可接受的算力增量换回能训更长序列、更大批量的能力。</p>\n<h2 id=\"跨卡切序列-ring-attention-与序列并行\">跨卡切序列：Ring Attention 与序列并行</h2><p>重计算解决了单卡的显存，但一条 1M token 的序列，光是 KV 就可能超过单卡容量——必须把序列本身切开分到多张卡。难点在于注意力是全局的：切在卡 0 上的 query 需要和切在卡 7 上的 key 做注意力，天真切分会导致卡间要传输 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>×</mo><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N\\times N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">×</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 的分数。</p>\n<p><strong>Ring Attention</strong> 的巧思是把设备排成一个环，每张卡持有一段 Q（固定不动）和一段 K/V。计算分多轮进行：每轮各卡用本地 Q 与当前手上的 K/V 块做一次 FlashAttention 式的分块累加，然后把自己的 K/V 块沿环传给下一张卡。转满一圈，每段 Q 就与全部 K/V 都算过了。关键在于 <strong>K/V 的环形传输能与注意力计算重叠</strong>——通信被计算掩盖，几乎不增加墙钟时间。由于每张卡只需存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 的序列，理论上加卡就能线性扩展可处理的序列长度。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>技术</th>\n<th>切分维度</th>\n<th>解决的瓶颈</th>\n<th>通信模式</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>梯度检查点/重计算</td>\n<td>时间（重算）</td>\n<td>单卡激活显存</td>\n<td>无（单卡内）</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Ring Attention</td>\n<td>序列长度</td>\n<td>单卡装不下长序列</td>\n<td>环形传 K/V，与计算重叠</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>序列并行（如 LASP-2）</td>\n<td>序列长度</td>\n<td>长序列训练吞吐</td>\n<td>优化的集合通信</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数据并行</td>\n<td>批量</td>\n<td>吞吐</td>\n<td>梯度 all-reduce</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>2025 年的 <strong>LASP-2</strong> 进一步为线性注意力重新设计了序列并行，把通信从与序列长度相关降到近乎常数（<a href=\"https://arxiv.org/pdf/2502.07563\">arXiv:2502.07563</a>），使 <a href=\"../sparse-linear/linear-attention\">线性注意力</a> 的混合模型也能高效跨卡训超长序列。</p>\n<h2 id=\"分块思想的统一视角\">分块思想的统一视角</h2><p>把这一章串起来看，会发现 FlashAttention、重计算、Ring Attention 是<strong>同一个原理在不同层级的复用</strong>：都在用「分块 + 只保留必要的小状态 + 需要时重算或传输」来绕开「一次性物化一个大对象」的显存墙。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"flowchart\" data-source=\"flowchart TD&#10;    Idea[&quot;核心原理&lt;br/&gt;分块 + 保留小状态 + 重算/传输&quot;] --&gt; L1[&quot;SRAM 层级&lt;br/&gt;FlashAttention: 不落地 N×N&quot;]&#10;    Idea --&gt; L2[&quot;单卡层级&lt;br/&gt;重计算: 不存中间激活&quot;]&#10;    Idea --&gt; L3[&quot;多卡层级&lt;br/&gt;Ring Attention: 不让单卡存整序列&quot;]&#10;    L1 --&gt; Same[&quot;共同点: 用算力/通信换显存&lt;br/&gt;结果与朴素实现数值等价&quot;]&#10;    L2 --&gt; Same&#10;    L3 --&gt; Same\">flowchart TD\n    Idea[\"核心原理&lt;br/&gt;分块 + 保留小状态 + 重算/传输\"] --&gt; L1[\"SRAM 层级&lt;br/&gt;FlashAttention: 不落地 N×N\"]\n    Idea --&gt; L2[\"单卡层级&lt;br/&gt;重计算: 不存中间激活\"]\n    Idea --&gt; L3[\"多卡层级&lt;br/&gt;Ring Attention: 不让单卡存整序列\"]\n    L1 --&gt; Same[\"共同点: 用算力/通信换显存&lt;br/&gt;结果与朴素实现数值等价\"]\n    L2 --&gt; Same\n    L3 --&gt; Same</pre><p>这个统一视角很实用：当你在任何层级撞到「某个 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msup><mi>N</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N^2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.8141em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.063em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span> 或 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">N</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span></span></span></span></span> 大小的对象放不下」时，都可以套同一个模板——能不能分块、能不能只留小状态、代价是重算还是传输。它和降复杂度的方法正交，如 <a href=\"../foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy\">高效注意力谱系</a> 所述，可任意叠加。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>梯度检查点/重计算用「反向时重新前向」换掉「前向存所有激活」，以约 1.33 倍算力换取显存从 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>L</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(L)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 大降，是训练长序列的基本盘。</li>\n<li>FlashAttention 的反向内建重计算：前向只存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 的 softmax 统计量，反向据此在片上重算注意力块，故反向也是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>N</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(N)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.109em;\">N</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 显存、加速比略低于前向。</li>\n<li>Ring Attention 把序列切到多卡、环形传输 K/V 并与计算重叠，让单卡只存 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>P</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/P</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.1389em;\">P</span></span></span></span></span> 序列，加卡即可线性扩展可处理长度；LASP-2 为线性注意力优化了序列并行通信。</li>\n<li>三者是同一原理（分块+小状态+重算/传输换显存）在 SRAM、单卡、多卡三个层级的复用，与降复杂度方法正交可叠加。</li>\n<li>本篇管训练反向与多卡；前向 kernel 见 <a href=\"flash-attention\">FlashAttention</a>，解码阶段的分页 KV 见 <a href=\"paged-attention\">分页注意力</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"延伸阅读-跨库链接\">延伸阅读 / 跨库链接</h3><ul>\n<li>同章：<a href=\"flash-attention\">FlashAttention IO 感知</a>、<a href=\"paged-attention\">分页注意力</a></li>\n<li>原理归位：<a href=\"../foundations/efficient-attention-taxonomy\">高效注意力谱系</a></li>\n<li>受益方：<a href=\"../sparse-linear/linear-attention\">线性注意力</a> 的混合模型跨卡训练</li>\n<li>跨 hub：百万 token 训练的整体工程见 <a href=\"../../long-context-llm-techniques/practice/frontier-million-token\">62_long-context-llm-techniques / 前沿百万 token</a></li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"分块与重计算","id":"分块与重计算"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：用算力换显存的基本盘","id":"核心概念-用算力换显存的基本盘"},{"level":2,"text":"FlashAttention 的反向：重计算是内建的","id":"flashattention-的反向-重计算是内建的"},{"level":2,"text":"跨卡切序列：Ring Attention 与序列并行","id":"跨卡切序列-ring-attention-与序列并行"},{"level":2,"text":"分块思想的统一视角","id":"分块思想的统一视角"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"},{"level":3,"text":"延伸阅读 / 跨库链接","id":"延伸阅读-跨库链接"}],"prev":{"title":"FlashAttention IO 感知","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/flash-attention"},"next":{"title":"分页注意力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/ai-llm/efficient-attention-mechanisms/io-aware/paged-attention"}}